137
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:14,291
Rym: Yep.

138
00:09:14,331 --> 00:09:24,550
Rym: But it is basically after a moment that's happened a few episodes ago, it just turns to the side and starts heading straight toward that plot as hard as possible.

139
00:09:25,071 --> 00:09:31,247
Scott: So people should also know that in the United States at least, volume 14 of the manga is the final volume.

140
00:09:31,267 --> 00:09:32,250
