Scott: I don't know.

153
00:10:05,793 --> 00:10:07,075
Scott: News, thing of the day, whatever.

154
00:10:07,135 --> 00:10:08,298
Scott: But basically this is movie.

155
00:10:08,939 --> 00:10:12,947
Scott: It's an independent Chinese animated film called Art College 1994.

156
00:10:12,947 --> 00:10:14,210
Scott: You can watch the trailer.

157
