166
00:11:08,937 --> 00:11:16,890
Scott: You know, not just the normal art school life that you would have if you would say art school US 1994.

167
00:11:16,890 --> 00:11:17,847
Scott: I know what that looks like.

168
00:11:18,350 --> 00:11:22,316
Scott: Right, but so take that and add in China 1994, right?

169
00:11:22,957 --> 00:11:30,950
Scott: And, you know, hey, it's going to be in theaters starting Friday and I guess at least next week in New York City.

170
00:11:31,010 --> 00:11:32,833
