171
00:11:33,915 --> 00:11:35,738
Scott: It's probably, you know, it's a super indie film.

172
00:11:35,818 --> 00:11:37,480
Scott: It's not only indie, it's foreign also.

173
00:11:37,540 --> 00:11:43,590
Scott: The double whammy of unlikely to screen at the Regal AMC big theater chain.

174
00:11:45,592 --> 00:11:47,176
Rym: I don't know if it's because I'm getting older.

