179
00:12:08,814 --> 00:12:21,029
Scott: There is a, I don't want to say large or even significant, but that the Fantastic Four movie that's coming, you know, Fantastic Four is not my favorite superhero.

180
00:12:21,049 --> 00:12:21,670
Scott: They're okay.

