00:12:57,267 --> 00:12:59,070
Scott: So there you go.

189
00:12:59,430 --> 00:13:07,820
Rym: I feel like I sent me down this road with specifically, you know, Fargo, the movie, which is like S tier movie, but the TV show is an S tier TV show.

190
00:13:07,841 --> 00:13:15,650
Rym: Like it shocked me how good it is, but every season of it is also a period piece because they are set in very specific times and it matters a lot.

191
00:13:15,830 --> 00:13:17,134
Scott: It's just very, that's how they do it.

