Scott: So it's like, so it's like episode, it's like season one, grandpa, season two, grandkids, season three, even more grandchild.

194
00:13:31,671 --> 00:13:36,759
Rym: But they're so well done that it doesn't matter what order you watch the seasons in either because they're all completely standalone.

