357
00:25:46,896 --> 00:25:49,000
Scott: You would take the picture, you couldn't look at it right away.

358
00:25:49,761 --> 00:25:56,293
Scott: You would advance your film one frame, take another picture, and then you would have to like, I don't know, keep notes on like.

