491
00:35:16,162 --> 00:35:18,999
Scott: I went, I went and cleared out my patreons a while ago.

492
00:35:19,300 --> 00:35:20,937
Rym: I went and cleared mine out recently too.

493
00:35:21,580 --> 00:35:31,360
