00:37:13,780 --> 00:37:28,380
Rym: And the Patreon patrons for this episode of GeekNights are Alan Joyce, Linki G, Dreville, Intenipre, Case, Care, Mixmusic, Chris, The Dot, Christopher, Orr, Clinton, Walton, Finn, Joel Hayes, Penny Reimer, Rebecca Dunn, Sam Erickson, Shervin Von Hurl, and tons of people whose names I will never forget.

517
00:37:28,380 --> 00:37:43,000
Rym: It seems like the theme that emerged from this episode is that Scott and I, and maybe you, ball like media where what happens is the least important aspect of the media.

518
00:37:43,880 --> 00:37:53,060
Rym: And now I leave you, now that I'm going to try to come up with whatever the theme of the episode was for every episode going forward right here in the stinger, before I leave you with some nonsense, here's some nonsense.

